WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.182
Headache red flags.

2
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:06.010
The features that call for urgent investigation of a new headache.

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.585
Migraine is a clinical diagnosis.

4
00:00:09.035 --> 00:00:13.156
Red flags should be excluded before attributing headache to migraine.

5
00:00:13.606 --> 00:00:19.005
Treat early in the attack with an effective dose; combination with an antiemetic helps some patients.

6
00:00:19.455 --> 00:00:22.485
Consider prevention when attacks are frequent or disabling.

7
00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:26.778
Several drug classes and CGRP-targeted options are available.
